4:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Most advertisers obsess over the first two. But the third-the landing page-is where the real leverage lives. If the page breaks the chain, relevance and CTR will also suffer over time."}]
5:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The page factors that tank Quality Score"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Google evaluates your landing page on factors you can actually control:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Load speed:"}]," If the page takes more than 3 seconds, mobile searchers bounce before it renders. Speed is not just UX-it is eligibility."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Content match:"}]," Does the first screen repeat the promise from the ad? If someone searches \"emergency plumber same day\" and lands on a generic \"About Us\" page, the match is broken."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Click-through behavior:"}]," Do people who land stay long enough to take action? If they bounce in under 5 seconds, Google lowers the score for that keyword-page pair."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The pattern: searcher picks an ad based on a promise, arrives, does not see that promise reflected immediately, and leaves. The page leaked the click."}]]}]
6:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Quick wins: match the headline to the keyword"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"A consistent Quality Score improvement is also the simplest: make the hero headline repeat the exact keyword phrase the searcher used."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Example:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Search:"}]," \"google ads quality score low\""]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Ad promise:"}]," \"Quality Score tanking? Fix the page, not the account\""]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Landing page headline:"}]," \"Google Ads Quality Score Low? Fix The Page Before The Account\""]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"This is not clever copywriting. It is mechanical match reinforcement. When the searcher sees their exact intent reflected back, they stay. When they stay, Google raises the Quality Score."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Other quick wins:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex item